Vita (--vita-fast-shadow-collect=off|on|verify): real-time shadow ground polygon collection
(realPolygonCheck -> cBgS::ShdwDraw -> dBgWKCol / cBgW walkers -> psdRealCallBack) with the same
receiver list. The fast walk stops once the 256-triangle list is full (later callbacks can change
nothing) and skips a KC prism before building its vertices when psdRealCallBack would reject its
plane on the light/centre tests (same expressions, vertices unused). verify runs the original walk
